 "name_en": "Group Valuation (5W2)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Group Valuation (5W2)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa966f5e3e8ba422c93d27cbccc3bae6d\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa966f5e3e8ba422c93d27cbccc3bae6d__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item results in the activation of an additional ledger to store the consolidated view on the intercompany business transactions. Intercompany transactions take place in accordance with the Advanced Intercompany Sales (5D2) and Advanced Intercompany Stock Transfer (5HP) scope items. This scope item extends the Standard Cost Calculation (BEG) scope item to support the calculation of standard costs across different plants and company codes and to deliver a consolidated view on the standard costs and actual costing (see the Actual Costing (33Q) scope item) to provide a consolidated view on the actual costs across the value chain.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa966f5e3e8ba422c93d27cbccc3bae6d__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform ledger-specific valuations in Asset Accounting, General Ledger, and Controlling</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute costing run to set standard costs in group view</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute costing run to calculate actual costs in group view</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa966f5e3e8ba422c93d27cbccc3bae6d__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Provides a management view of the cost structure that is not distorted by intercompany profits</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provides the first step towards group reporting by eliminating intercompany profits in real time</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>集团评估 (5W2)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa966f5e3e8ba422c93d27cbccc3bae6d\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa966f5e3e8ba422c93d27cbccc3bae6d__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目导致激活附加分类账，以存储公司间业务交易的合并视图。公司间交易根据高级公司间销售 (5D2) 和高级公司间库存转储 (5HP) 范围项目进行。此范围项目扩展了标准成本计算 (BEG) 范围项目，以支持不同工厂和公司代码的标准成本计算，并提供标准成本和实际成本核算的合并视图（请参阅实际成本核算 (33Q) 范围项目），以提供整个价值链中实际成本的合并视图。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa966f5e3e8ba422c93d27cbccc3bae6d__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在资产会计、总账和成本控制中执行分类账特定评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行成本核算运行，在组视图中设置标准成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行成本核算运行，在组视图中计算实际成本</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa966f5e3e8ba422c93d27cbccc3bae6d__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">提供公司间利润不会扭曲的成本结构的管理视图。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过实时消除公司间利润，为集团报表提供第一步</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
